# The trial binary is 60 MB and rebuildable from the commit the write-up names.
bin/
# Pilot output is scratch: it exists to check the equipment, not to be read
# later. results.jsonl is the artifact, and it is committed with its raw
# stdout so a scoring mistake is rescored rather than re-run.
pilot.jsonl

# results.jsonl is held back *while the batch runs*: the file is open in a
# live process, so whatever is committed mid-run is an arbitrary prefix of it.
# This line is removed in the same commit that lands the finished results, so
# the exclusion cannot outlive its reason.
results.jsonl
